00:50:17.770 --> 00:50:25.370
allowed to search for the Lady Barbara. The brave deserve their favours. Go, brother, write your letter.

00:50:30.000 --> 00:50:42.620
Sincerity deserves our honest dealings, but caution, yes, caution insists that my armies are ready.

00:50:54.510 --> 00:50:56.120
