Nothing must be here. Somewhere. Search every corner. No!

00:52:30.030 --> 00:52:31.980
Wait, I've a better plan.

00:52:32.560 --> 00:52:35.050
Bring a torch. We'll smoke the secret out.

00:52:35.780 --> 00:52:37.480
